  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Oversight and Quality Assurance Service by World Bank - for SCRS - WASH Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is to provide oversight on behalf of the Consolidated WaSH Account (CWA) pooled fund contributing Development Partners on the implementation of the One WaSH National Programme Phase II, which also includes the implementation of FCDO&#x2019;s support of Strengthening Climate Resilient Systems for Water, Sanitation and Hygiene Services in Ethiopia (SCRS &#x2013; WaSH) as part of the Climate Resilient Component of OWNP CWA. The Externally Financed Output (EFO) primarily support the World Bank&#x2019;s oversight role to ensure that the implementation of OWNP-CWA Phase II is in accordance with the commonly agreed fiduciary, social and environmental safeguard requirements as stated in the CWA Program Operational Manual (POM).</narrative>
  </description>
